<%@ page pageEncoding="UTF-8" %>
<div class="journey-pass-list"><c:forEach var="j" items="${journeyList}"><article class="journey-card pass-card journey-business-card ${not empty j.coverImage ? 'has-cover' : ''}" data-status="${j.status}"><c:set var="cover" value="${j}"/><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover.jspf" %><div class="pass-card-main"><span class="journey-ticket-status"><c:out value="${j.statusLabel}"/></span><h2><a class="journey-card-link" aria-label="${fn:escapeXml(j.name)} · ${j.status eq 'PLANNING' ? '이어 만들기' : '패스 보기'}" href="${root}/journeys/${j.status eq 'PLANNING' ? 'edit' : 'detail'}?id=${j.id}"><c:out value="${j.name}"/></a></h2><p class="journey-ticket-date"><c:out value="${empty j.travelDate ? '날짜 미정' : j.travelDate}"/> · ${j.placeCount}장</p><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/journey/journey-cover-credit.jspf" %><c:if test="${j.status eq 'PLANNING'}"><button type="button" class="journey-ticket-delete" popovertarget="pass-delete-${j.id}" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="패스 삭제" title="패스 삭제"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 7h16M9 7V4h6v3M6 7l1 13h10l1-13M10 11v5m4-5v5"/></svg><span class="visually-hidden">패스 삭제</span></button><section id="pass-delete-${j.id}" class="pass-cover-popover journey-delete-popover" popover role="dialog" aria-labelledby="pass-delete-${j.id}-title"><div class="pass-cover-popover-heading"><h2 id="pass-delete-${j.id}-title">패스 삭제</h2><button type="button" class="secondary" popovertarget="pass-delete-${j.id}" popovertargetaction="hide" autofocus>닫기</button></div><p>임시 저장한 내용이 삭제되며 되돌릴 수 없습니다.</p><form method="post" action="${root}/journeys/delete"><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/shared/csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${j.id}"><button>이 패스 삭제</button></form></section></c:if><c:if test="${j.status eq 'CONFIRMED'}">
<button type="button" class="journey-ticket-action" popovertarget="pass-status-${j.id}" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-label="패스 상태 변경" title="패스 상태 변경"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 4h16v4H4zM6 8v12h12V8M10 12h4"/></svg><span class="visually-hidden">패스 상태 변경</span></button>
<section id="pass-status-${j.id}" class="pass-cover-popover" popover role="dialog" aria-labelledby="pass-status-${j.id}-title"><div class="pass-cover-popover-heading"><h2 id="pass-status-${j.id}-title">패스 상태 변경</h2><button type="button" class="secondary" popovertarget="pass-status-${j.id}" popovertargetaction="hide" autofocus>닫기</button></div><p>여행을 마쳤다면 사용 완료로 보관하고 기록을 남기세요. 사용 완료는 되돌릴 수 없어요. ${empty j.issuedPassId ? '구성을 바꾸려면 제작 중으로 되돌릴 수 있습니다.' : '투어패스를 구매한 여행은 구성을 바꾸거나 삭제할 수 없어요.'}</p><form method="post" action="${root}/journeys/save"><%@ include file="/WEB-INF/views/shared/csrf.jspf" %><input type="hidden" name="id" value="${j.id}"><button name="status" value="ARCHIVED">사용 완료 · 아카이브</button><c:if test="${empty j.issuedPassId}"><button class="secondary" name="status" value="PLANNING">제작 중으로 보내기</button></c:if></form></section>
</c:if></div></article></c:forEach></div>
